I have had problems in the past making Legato (full licensed version with all the bits)
use both heads of a TL891 at the same time.
I have also had problems getting it to see fibre attached tape (although this was on
a V4 cluster).
The version which was bundled with V4 was a full version capable of backing up
a single server (no good for a cluster).
The version bundled with V5 was a 30day evaluation copy.
So you will need to buy a solution or roll your own.
Go direct to Veritas and Legato to avoid the problem of the Compaq guy getting
the commission.
